      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "The demon army's repeated invasions\nare no longer even called a threat,"
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "After several centuries, one could\nsay we finally overcame the darkness."
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "Light fills every corner of this continent,\nand the darkness has been driven out."
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "Even their magical power is\nchild's play before our weapons."
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 101,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "",
          0,
          0,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "But once that came to pass, humanity, at a loss\nover the arsenal built to purge the demons,"
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "began to war among themselves. There is no\ndarkness on the continent. Everything is"
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "lit by civilization's lights. Wild monsters,\ntoo, will vanish from the continent"
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "in the near future. Yet that was not a victory."
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 101,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "",
          0,
          0,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "having driven out the demons and the\nDark, we must ask whether we are truly"
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "righteous compared to them. Both sides have\nbirthed darkness within and amplified it;"
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "unless we who have done so turn our eyes\nupon it, the true darkness will, in the end,"
        ]
      },
      {
        "code": 401,
        "indent": 0,
        "parameters": [
          "only change its shape and grow all the more powerful."
        ]
      },
